          "descriptions": [
            {
              "descriptionType": "Abstract",
              "description": "Python code for narrowband-to-broadband (NB2BB)  conversion and angular distribution models (ADMs), supporting a manuscript submitted to EGU Earth Observation. Includes simulation based regression fits and radiance-to-flux conversion using GOES-16/18 ABI data. See README and README_installation for usage and requirements.txt for dependencies. Version v1.0.0 corresponds to the submitted manuscript."
